    <Label Name="Description" Style="GalleryText" Text="Drag the time slider to watch the show.\n\nWhen a firework bursts, its sparks shoot out every which way, and gravity pulls all of them down alike. So the sparks that fly equally fast always stay on a circle, one that grows and drops at once. Check &quot;Circles&quot; to see them.\n\nDrag a firework to move it. To change its sparks, click one, choose Edit this style and pick another emoji." Pin="TopRight" OffsetX="16" OffsetY="64" WrapWidth="400" Backdrop="true" />
